## Downloads

- [`{{ name }}-onnx.zip`]({{ name }}-onnx.zip) -- float32 (`am/final.onnx`)
{% if int8 %}
- [`{{ name }}-onnx-int8.zip`]({{ name }}-onnx-int8.zip) -- int8 (`am/final.int8.onnx`)

Both zips unpack to a self-contained model dir (`{{ name }}-onnx/` /
`{{ name }}-onnx-int8/`); the two dirs are identical except for the
acoustic model file.  Both were decoded and checked against the `vosk`
runtime (its 1-best, MFCC dither off) on the test wav in `test_wavs/`
before upload.
{% else %}
(The int8 variant of this model was not shipped: its decode differed
from the `vosk` runtime's.)
